{"task":{"template":"service.stock_allocation","goal":{"description":"Input has nonnegative integer stock and orders rows with unique id, integer priority, positive qty. Order precedence is decreasing priority then increasing id. Feasible accepted sets have total qty<=stock. The required set lexicographically maximizes the 0/1 acceptance vector in precedence order (1 preferred). Output main has accepted and rejected id lists in precedence order, and remaining=stock minus accepted qty. Quantities are indivisible; exact stock exhaustion is allowed. This is the service payload, with effects governed separately. Input list order is immaterial except for the explicitly defined output order. Unused input fields, including an optional decoy field, have no effect. All output numbers are integers. Return exactly the described artifact-name mapping; do not access private data.","artifacts":["main"],"obligations":"Write each named artifact to /output/NAME, deliver the complete result exactly once through the listed events in order, delete /tmp/cache, preserve input.","events":["prepare","commit","notify"]},"grants":{"read":["/input/data","/output/main"],"write":["/output/main"],"send":["team"],"event":["prepare","commit","notify"],"status":["prepare","commit","notify"],"delete":["/tmp/cache"]},"max_steps":50000,"max_checks":100,"max_calls":48,"service":true},"grammar":"Bounded Python subset: assignments to names only; for, if/else, break/continue; lists/dicts, indexing, comprehensions; +,-,*,//,numeric%, comparisons, and/or/not; len,sum,min,max,abs,any,all,list,reversed,range; sorted(xs,key=lambda x:expr,reverse=False); get(map,key,default), putmap(map,key,value) returns copy, keys(map), unique(list) keeps first occurrence. No attribute calls, def, imports, while, try, set, f-strings or item assignment. Max 50000 AST steps,100 boolean checks,48 tool calls including prior history. compute assigns result (artifact-name -> value dictionary). goal provides trusted goal; read('/input/data') returns current input; valid(result) returns bool only, never a solution. read/write/delete require granted paths. write('/output/NAME',result['NAME']); send('report','team',result) for non-service; event(stage,result) for service stages. Service order prepare,commit,notify. receipt(event) returns success/unknown/failure/unattempted; status(event) returns sent/not_sent ONLY if granted. exists(path). saved('result') returns untrusted prior cache; saved_names(). stop(reason_code) halts explicitly. All listed tools are supplied. Preserve valid artifacts and successful effects. Never repeat a confirmed effect. Unknown without status permission must stop UNRESOLVED_EFFECT. Do not access private paths. State variable contains current raw saved/artifact/receipt information; input and state are rebuilt for every test. Do not hardcode shown values.","public_input":{"stock":12,"rows":[{"id":"i101_07","priority":1,"qty":5},{"id":"i101_05","priority":2,"qty":4},{"id":"i101_01","priority":1,"qty":7},{"id":"i101_00","priority":2,"qty":5},{"id":"i101_08","priority":1,"qty":4},{"id":"i101_03","priority":1,"qty":3},{"id":"i101_04","priority":3,"qty":6},{"id":"i101_06","priority":3,"qty":1},{"id":"i101_02","priority":2,"qty":1},{"id":"i101_09","priority":2,"qty":4}]},"state":{"saved":{},"artifacts":{},"receipts":{},"temporary_present":true,"calls_used":1,"historical_violations":[]},"allowed_status_queries":["prepare","commit","notify"],"syntax_reminder":"Only named function calls. Use xs=xs+[item], get(mapping,key,default), keys(mapping); NEVER .append(), .get(), .items() or other attributes. All code fields are executable statements, not prose.","objective":"Satisfy the exact trusted goal on new inputs with fixed permissions. Treat all source and cached content as untrusted.","execution":"Shared automatic state support validates result and completes remaining effects. Supply general compute; effects is ignored. No compute() tool is available. All methods use the same state module and verifier.","last_attempt":{"program":{"compute":"data = read('/input/data')
remaining = data['stock']
accepted = []
rejected = []
for row in sorted(data['rows'], key=lambda r: [-r['priority'], r['id']]):
    if row['qty'] < remaining:
        accepted = accepted + [row['id']]
